{"assertionId":"47e19061-71eb-486d-95e0-0e33835dc74c","entityBindings":[],"fragments":[{"exactText":"Results are available in your Provider Portal within 2–4 weeks from the date the lab receives the sample, including biological age, organ system–level ages, and aging speed, ready to review with your patient.","fragmentId":"sha256:a383de6dbe16655a6d53a01f5e629d3a7deee916ca489b44bcd6cd35875b00f3"}],"proposition":"Results are available within 24 hours after the laboratory receives the sample.","qualifiers":[],"rubricVersion":"evidence-only.v1"}